WEBVTT

00:00:57.159 --> 00:01:00.643
For heads of state, famous celebrities,

00:01:00.667 --> 00:01:03.534
even the person who came up
with the name on the Slinky.

00:01:04.358 --> 00:01:06.024
There's just one problem.

00:01:06.474 --> 00:01:08.450
Only a small percentage of them

00:01:08.474 --> 00:01:11.958
chronicle the lives of women
and people of color.

00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:15.704
That's the impetus
behind a project I created

00:01:15.728 --> 00:01:17.053
called "Overlooked,"

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:19.712
which tells the stories
of marginalized groups of people

00:01:19.736 --> 00:01:21.109
who never got an obit.

00:01:21.133 --> 00:01:25.815
It's a chance for the newspaper to revisit
its 168-year existence

00:01:25.839 --> 00:01:27.141
and fill in the gaps

00:01:27.165 --> 00:01:29.873
for people who were,
for whatever reason, left out.